---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writings
permalink: /writings/
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Writings
  order: 30

---

{% set image = '/assets/images/other/patrick-fore-unsplash.jpg' %}
{# Photo by Patrick Fore (@patrickian4) on Unsplash: https://unsplash.com/photos/0gkw_9fy0eQ #}
{% set subtitle = 'A collection of articles and insights from technology to life experiences.' %}
{% set hero_hide_date = true %}
{% set hero_overlay_opacity = '0.35' %}
{% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

<!-- Introductory Paragraphs -->
<div class="container">
  <div class="notification is-light is-size-5 mb-5" style="background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 8px;">
    <p>Welcome! Here you'll find a growing library of personal essays, technical guides, and reflections on creativity, resilience, and the digital world. Each article is written to inspire, inform, and encourage you—whether you're seeking practical advice or a moment of connection.</p>
    <p>Browse the latest posts or explore by category. I hope these writings spark new ideas, offer comfort, and help you feel a little less alone in your journey. Dive in and join the conversation!</p>
  </div>



  <!-- Content Section -->
{% set categories = collections.writingsByCategory | keys | sort %}
<nav class="category-jumps" aria-label="Writing categories">
  <p>Jump to a category:</p>
  <ul>
    {% for category in categories %}
      <li><a href="#category-{{ category }}">{{ writingCategories[category] or category | capitalize }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>
{% for category in categories %}
  {% set categorySlug = category | lower | replace(' ', '-') %}
  {% set articles = collections.writingsByCategory[category] %}
    <section class="section writing-category" aria-labelledby="category-{{ categorySlug }}">
      <h2 class="title is-4" id="category-{{ categorySlug }}" tabindex="-1">{{ writingCategories[category] or category | capitalize }}</h2>
      <div class="books-grid" data-category="{{ categorySlug }}">
        {% for article in articles %}
          {% if article.data.publishedDate | isPublished %}
            <article class="book-card post-card paginated-item" data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}">
              {% if article.data.image %}
                <div class="card-media">
                  <img class="card-media-img" src="{{ article.data.image }}" alt="{{ article.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              <header class="card-header">
                <p class="title is-5"><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></p>
                <p class="card-published-date"><span class="icon is-small is-primary" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-calendar"></i></span> <time datetime="{{ article.data.publishedDate | htmlDateString }}">{{ article.data.publishedDate | dateDisplay }}</time></p>
              </header>

              <div class="card-body">
                <p class="content-preview">{{ article.data.description }}</p>
              </div>

              <footer class="card-footer">
                {% if article.data.tags %}
                  <div class="tags mt-auto">
                    {% for tag in article.data.tags %}
                      <span class="tag is-primary is-light">{{ tag }}</span>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <a class="button is-link mt-2" href="{{ article.url }}">Read More</a>
              </footer>
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <nav class="pagination-controls" aria-label="{{ writingCategories[category] or category }} pages" data-category="{{ categorySlug }}" hidden></nav>
        <p class="pagination-status" data-category="{{ categorySlug }}" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% include "partials/newsletter-cta.njk" %}

<style>
  .post-card {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .post-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .content-preview {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .title.is-5 a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .title.is-5 a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .tags {
    margin-top: auto;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .tag {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .category-jumps ul { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.75rem; list-style:none; padding:0; }
  .category-jumps a { display:inline-block; padding:0.5rem 0.75rem; border:1px solid currentColor; border-radius:4px; }
  .writing-category h2 { scroll-margin-top:6rem; }
  .category-jumps a:focus-visible, .pagination-button:focus-visible, .writing-category h2:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #332E63; outline-offset:4px; }
  .pagination-status { text-align:center; margin-top:0.5rem; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .post-card { transition:none; }
    .post-card:hover { transform:none; }
  }
</style>

<script src="/assets/js/writings-pagination.js" defer></script>

<style>
  .pagination-controls:not([hidden]) { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; margin-top:1rem; justify-content:center; }
  .pagination-button { background:#fff; border:1px solid #ddd; min-width:2.75rem; min-height:2.75rem; padding:0.4rem 0.6rem; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; }
  .pagination-button.is-active { background:var(--primary,#332E63); color:#fff; border-color:transparent; }
</style>
